  "id": "section-300",
  "title": "给徐悲鸿的一封信",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-003.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>003)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n悲鸿先生：<br>\n<br>\n　　表示敬悉，写了一张，未知可用否？<br>\n<br>\n　　顺颂教琪。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br>\n<br>\n　　一九四九年十一月二十九日</p>\n<br>\n　　（注：新中国刚刚成立，徐悲鸿先生敬请伟大领袖毛主席为中央美术学院题字，此为主席复信。）<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-002.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-004.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
